    "Recorded CBL reporting-threshold decision.": ["Recorded CBL reporting-threshold decision.", "قرار عتبات الإبلاغ لدى المصرف المركزي المسجل."],
    "The decision register records whether the CBL reporting thresholds are provisional or confirmed. Each reporting rule carries its own mode and schema, so this key does not unblock filing by itself.": ["The decision register records whether the CBL reporting thresholds are provisional or confirmed. Each reporting rule carries its own mode and schema, so this key does not unblock filing by itself.", "يسجل سجل القرارات ما إذا كانت عتبات الإبلاغ مؤقتة أم مؤكدة. كل قاعدة إبلاغ تحمل وضعها ومخططها، لذا لا يفتح هذا المفتاح الإيداع وحده."],
    "Recorded emergency-suspension ratification policy.": ["Recorded emergency-suspension ratification policy.", "سياسة المصادقة على الإيقاف الطارئ المسجلة."],
    "The decision register records who must ratify an emergency suspension and the window. The Deadline worker uses the approved automation policy; this key is the recorded decision.": ["The decision register records who must ratify an emergency suspension and the window. The Deadline worker uses the approved automation policy; this key is the recorded decision.", "يسجل سجل القرارات من يجب أن يصادق على الإيقاف الطارئ والمهلة. عامل المواعيد يستخدم سياسة الأتمتة المعتمدة؛ هذا المفتاح هو القرار المسجل."],
