    "The decision register records which roles are provisioned as named checker accounts. Actual users, roles and authorities are managed in Admin Users.": ["The decision register records which roles are provisioned as named checker accounts. Actual users, roles and authorities are managed in Admin Users.", "يسجل سجل القرارات الأدوار المهيّأة كحسابات معتمِدين بأسماء. المستخدمون والأدوار والصلاحيات الفعلية تُدار في مستخدمي الإدارة."],
    "Retired sandbox-before-approval decision.": ["Retired sandbox-before-approval decision.", "قرار البيئة التجريبية قبل الاعتماد المتقاعد."],
    "The v38 execution-plane change removed this switch. Sandbox is a separate plane and database; the Live plane refuses non-ACTIVE merchants. The key is kept for history.": ["The v38 execution-plane change removed this switch. Sandbox is a separate plane and database; the Live plane refuses non-ACTIVE merchants. The key is kept for history.", "أزال تغيير مستوى التنفيذ v38 هذا المفتاح. البيئة التجريبية مستوى وقاعدة بيانات منفصلان؛ والمستوى الحي يرفض التجار غير النشطين. يُحفظ المفتاح للسجل."],
    "Editing a retired key wastes time and can mislead an operator into thinking sandbox access changed.": ["Editing a retired key wastes time and can mislead an operator into thinking sandbox access changed.", "تعديل مفتاح متقاعد يضيع الوقت وقد يوهم المشغل بأن وصول البيئة التجريبية تغيّر."],
    "Retired in v38. Sandbox is a separate execution plane.": ["Retired in v38. Sandbox is a separate execution plane.", "متقاعد في v38. البيئة التجريبية مستوى تنفيذ منفصل."],
    "Record retention period used by the retention worker.": ["Record retention period used by the retention worker.", "مدة الاحتفاظ المستخدمة بواسطة عامل الاحتفاظ."],
    "The retention worker (disabled by default) reads this key to decide how long KYB and related records are kept. Enabling the worker can delete evidence older than this period.": ["The retention worker (disabled by default) reads this key to decide how long KYB and related records are kept. Enabling the worker can delete evidence older than this period.", "يقرأ عامل الاحتفاظ (المعطل افتراضياً) هذا المفتاح لتحديد مدة حفظ سجلات KYB والمرتبطة. تفعيل العامل قد يحذف الأدلة الأقدم من هذه المدة."],
    "Retention worker (`RetentionWorker`); the worker is disabled unless `WORKER_RETENTION_ENABLED=true`.": ["Retention worker (`RetentionWorker`); the worker is disabled unless `WORKER_RETENTION_ENABLED=true`.", "عامل الاحتفاظ (`RetentionWorker`)؛ العامل معطّل ما لم يكن `WORKER_RETENTION_ENABLED=true`."],
    "The next retention run. A shorter period can delete evidence on that run.": ["The next retention run. A shorter period can delete evidence on that run.", "تشغيل الاحتفاظ التالي. مدة أقصر قد تحذف أدلة في ذلك التشغيل."],
