    "Three-letter currency code, for example LYD.": ["Three-letter currency code, for example LYD.", "رمز عملة من ثلاثة أحرف، مثل LYD."],
    "Default KYB document codes required for every applicant, one code per chip, for example COMMERCIAL_REGISTRY.": ["Default KYB document codes required for every applicant, one code per chip, for example COMMERCIAL_REGISTRY.", "رموز مستندات KYB الافتراضية المطلوبة لكل متقدم، رمز لكل شريحة، مثل COMMERCIAL_REGISTRY."],
    "Category code to document codes. A category entry replaces the default list for that category.": ["Category code to document codes. A category entry replaces the default list for that category.", "رمز الفئة إلى رموز المستندات. إدخال الفئة يستبدل القائمة الافتراضية لتلك الفئة."],
    "Expected monthly volume above which a second reviewer is required. Use a decimal amount, for example 250000.": ["Expected monthly volume above which a second reviewer is required. Use a decimal amount, for example 250000.", "الحجم الشهري المتوقع الذي يتطلب مراجعاً ثانياً. استخدم مبلغاً عشرياً، مثل 250000."],
    "Months between re-verification for HIGH-risk merchants. 12 = annually.": ["Months between re-verification for HIGH-risk merchants. 12 = annually.", "الأشهر بين إعادات التحقق للتجار عاليي المخاطر. 12 = سنوياً."],
    "Months between re-verification for STANDARD-risk merchants. 24 = every two years.": ["Months between re-verification for STANDARD-risk merchants. 24 = every two years.", "الأشهر بين إعادات التحقق للتجار متوسطي المخاطر. 24 = كل سنتين."],
    "Months between re-verification for LOW-risk merchants. 36 = every three years.": ["Months between re-verification for LOW-risk merchants. 36 = every three years.", "الأشهر بين إعادات التحقق للتجار منخفضي المخاطر. 36 = كل ثلاث سنوات."],
    "Days after a KYB expiry before the merchant is treated as overdue. 30 = one month.": ["Days after a KYB expiry before the merchant is treated as overdue. 30 = one month.", "الأيام بعد انتهاء KYB قبل اعتبار التاجر متأخراً. 30 = شهر واحد."],
    "Days before the next review when a revalidation request is opened. 30 = one month.": ["Days before the next review when a revalidation request is opened. 30 = one month.", "الأيام قبل المراجعة التالية عند فتح طلب إعادة التحقق. 30 = شهر واحد."],
    "Number of duplicate document reuses that triggers an AML review. 3 = the third reuse.": ["Number of duplicate document reuses that triggers an AML review. 3 = the third reuse.", "عدد مرات إعادة استخدام المستند المكرر التي تستدعي مراجعة AML. 3 = الاستخدام الثالث."],
    "Revision label. Publishing a new list with the same version keeps cached screening results; change the version to invalidate them.": ["Revision label. Publishing a new list with the same version keeps cached screening results; change the version to invalidate them.", "وسم المراجعة. نشر قائمة جديدة بالنسخة نفسها يبقي نتائج الفحص المخزنة؛ غيّر النسخة لإبطالها."],
    "One row per watched person or entity: entryRef, listType, listName, names[], identifiers[]. Malformed rows are ignored.": ["One row per watched person or entity: entryRef, listType, listName, names[], identifiers[]. Malformed rows are ignored.", "صف لكل شخص أو كيان مراقب: entryRef وlistType وlistName وnames[] وidentifiers[]. تُتجاهل الصفوف المشوهة."],
    "On: block the payment when screening fails (safe default). Off: allow the payment and record the screening as unknown.": ["On: block the payment when screening fails (safe default). Off: allow the payment and record the screening as unknown.", "مفعّل: احظر الدفعة عند فشل الفحص (الافتراضي الآمن). متوقف: اسمح بالدفعة وسجّل الفحص كغير معروف."],
    "Anti-self-dealing policy: a merchant paying into its own wallet or account.": ["Anti-self-dealing policy: a merchant paying into its own wallet or account.", "سياسة منع التعامل الذاتي: دفع التاجر إلى محفظته أو حسابه."],
